stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle
    Idle: History closed
    Loading: Loading completed wins
    Ready: Completed wins or genuine empty history
    Error: History unavailable
    Retired: Sign in again to read history
    Disposed: History removed
    Idle --> Loading: Open history
    Loading --> Ready: Valid current response
    Loading --> Error: Failed or invalid current response
    Ready --> Loading: Refresh or apply filters
    Error --> Loading: Refresh or apply filters
    Loading --> Loading: Newer request replaces pending request
    Idle --> Idle: Clear or pagehide
    Loading --> Idle: Clear or pagehide
    Ready --> Idle: Clear or pagehide
    Error --> Idle: Clear or pagehide
    Idle --> Retired: Session ends
    Loading --> Retired: Session ends
    Ready --> Retired: Session ends
    Error --> Retired: Session ends
    Retired --> Retired: Former controls, clear, pagehide, repeated invalidation, late response
    Idle --> Disposed: Dispose
    Loading --> Disposed: Dispose
    Ready --> Disposed: Dispose
    Error --> Disposed: Dispose
    Retired --> Disposed: Dispose
    Disposed --> Disposed: Saved callbacks, late response or repeated dispose
    %% never Show private rows or issue reads after the session ends or disposal.
    %% never Treat ordinary clear or pagehide as terminal session invalidation.
